OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for life after #10
OL,4,Aphone debt murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed his housemate to
OL,7,Fdeath over a #10 phone debt has been
OL,8,Fjailed for life.
OL,10,FMark Jesse, 51, attacked Charlie
OL,11,FBelsham at their address on Castle Road
OL,12,Fin Chatham on 1 November 2025, after
OL,13,FJesse became angered about a row
OL,14,Fbetween his victim and Ashley Robinson
OL,15,F- a visitor to the property - regarding
OL,16,Fthe sale of a mobile.
OL,18,FKent Police said Jesse later went to
OL,19,FBelsham's room, then reportedly emerged
OL,20,Fsaying: "I've stabbed him in the ribs."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
