OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for life after #10
OL,4,Aphone debt murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving previously been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurder, Jesse was jailed for a minimum
OL,8,Fof 20 years at Maidstone Crown Court on
OL,9,FFriday for "unjustifiable and rash"
OL,10,Factions which "tragically cut short
OL,11,Fsomeone's life over a simple argument",
OL,12,Faccording to police.
